Building a live record
Capture() branches on transaction type before reading type-dependent fields. It uses request and result only for TRADE_TRANSACTION_REQUEST. The session cache applies only to DEAL_ADD observations and is updated after a successful journal append. Other stages, including identical-looking requests and updates, are retained without heuristic merging.
