The EA compiled in MetaEditor with zero errors and zero warnings. The functional test used a Deriv demo account with the auditor attached to an XAUUSD H1 chart. It covered desktop and mobile observations, period selection, activity while detached, history reconciliation, repeated refresh, detail display, and export.
